s = \u0022/C start lghub.exe\u0022,","                        WorkingDirectory = Path.GetTempPath()","                    });","                    Close();","                }","                else","                {","                    LogManager.Log(LogManager.LogLevel.Error, \u0022File is improper, please try a different host.\u0022, true);","                }","            }","        }"],"startLine":102}